# Resistance of an NTC thermistor against temperature.
#
# A `$table_model` data file (LRM 2.4 section 9.21.1): one `x y` pair per line, columns
# separated by spaces or tabs, comments from `#` to the end of the line. verilog-a-sim also
# accepts `*` and `//` comments and comma separators; other simulators do not (Spectre stops
# with VLOGA-5070 on a `*` line), so this file keeps to the LRM's form. The rows need not be
# sorted -- elaboration sorts them, and rejects two rows that give one x two different y values.
#
